flowchart TD
    %% Start
    Start([Parent Request: execute_tasks]) --> ValidateDAG[Validate DAG Dependencies\nDetect cycles, missing deps, self-deps]

    %% Validation Check
    ValidateDAG --> Valid{Is DAG Valid?}
    Valid -- No --> Reject[Fail Fast: InvalidDependencyError]
    Valid -- Yes --> InitContext[Init Parent Correlation Context\nrun_id, user_id, project_id, depth=0]

    %% Main Scheduling Loop
    InitContext --> Loop{Tasks Remaining?}
    Loop -- No --> Aggregate[Topological Result Aggregation\nPreserve declared order]
    Aggregate --> ReturnResult([Return OrchestrationResult])

    %% Task Eligibility
    Loop -- Yes --> CheckEligible[Identify Eligible Tasks\nAll depends_on completed with SUCCESS]
    CheckEligible --> AcquireSemaphore[Acquire Concurrency Semaphore\nasyncio.Semaphore: max_concurrent_children=4]

    %% Execution Pipeline
    AcquireSemaphore --> ReserveBudget[Atomic Global Budget Reservation\nAtomic check: tokens_reserved + task_tokens <= max_global_tokens]
    ReserveBudget --> BudgetCheck{Budget Available?}

    BudgetCheck -- No --> FailBudget[Mark Task FAILED: Budget Exhausted]
    FailBudget --> ReleaseSemaphore[Release Semaphore]
    ReleaseSemaphore --> Loop

    BudgetCheck -- Yes --> ProjectContext[AgentContextProjector\nAllowlist task instructions, redact approval/transcripts]
    ProjectContext --> RestrictCaps[Compile Scoped Environment\nparent_caps ∩ agent_def.allowed_capabilities]

    RestrictCaps --> SpawnTask[Spawn Async Child Worker\nasyncio.create_task: execute_task]
    SpawnTask --> ReusedRuntime[Execute via Shared AgentRuntime\nNo separate child runtime class!]

    %% Worker Execution
    ReusedRuntime --> TaskDone{Execution Result}

    TaskDone -- Success --> StoreResult[Store AgentResult: SUCCESS\nAccumulate token usage]
    StoreResult --> ReleaseSemaphore

    TaskDone -- Timeout / Error --> HandleError[Record Error Status\nIf is_critical: Trigger Orchestration Abort]
    HandleError --> CancelTrigger{Is Critical Failure?}

    CancelTrigger -- Yes --> CascadeCancel[Trigger Cascading Cancellation\nasyncio.Event.set: Cancel pending/running tasks]
    CascadeCancel --> StoreResult

    CancelTrigger -- No --> StoreResult
